#: 42ea4f9da1a54407b9435b1522bfa4a6
msgid ""
"if :ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>` =2 inclusion zones overlap, a fence breach "
"will occur when crossing a boundary, even if within another inclusion zone, "
"UNLESS :ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>` bit 1 is set to make all "
"inclusions zones a union set."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>` =2 的包含区域重叠，穿越边界时将发生围栏突破，即使位于另一个包含区域内——除非 "
":ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>` 第 1 位设置为将所有包含区域视为并集。"

