#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:80
#: 88c74bbb8d3b423196c6a901375d2127
msgid ""
"Rover has no altitude actions, but if it reaches the Cylindrical fence "
"boundary in either Steering or Acro modes, it will simply stop and not move "
"beyond it. In other modes, it will execute the "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`."
msgstr ""
"Rover 没有高度动作，但在 Steering 或 Acro 模式下到达圆柱形围栏边界时，将简单停止，不继续前进。在其他模式下，将执行 "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:83
#: e290177a16da45f0933c5d3b3678730c
msgid "Copter Actions"
msgstr "Copter 动作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:85
#: af179c0a6f604de988cd73d542a901ef
msgid ""
"Copter will stop increasing altitude at :ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` "
"in Loiter, PosHold, and AltHold modes."
msgstr ""
"Copter 在 Loiter、PosHold 和 AltHold 模式下，将在 :ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>`"
" 处停止增加高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:87
#: 4b682e57267d4adf84b0f800cc9d31dd
msgid ""
"In Loiter mode, it will try to stop at the horizontal boundaries, but "
"declare a breach if exceeds the boundary."
msgstr "在 Loiter 模式下，将尝试在水平边界处停止，但若超出边界则声明突破。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:89
#: d0c68f1269124dbcb9fc79f886a48c7e
msgid ""
"In other modes, it will execute the :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` below "
"if the altitude or boundary is reached."
msgstr "在其他模式下，如果达到高度或边界，将执行以下 :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`。"

