#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:107
#: 536a693c77bb4fdfab463886f915cd9a
msgid ""
"RTL/HOLD,etc. means it will attempt RTL first, but if it can't switch to "
"that mode (ie for RTL, GPS lock is lost), it will attempt to switch to the "
"next,in this case HOLD."
msgstr ""
"RTL/HOLD 等表示将首先尝试 RTL，但如果无法切换到该模式（如 RTL 需要 GPS 锁定已丢失），则尝试切换到下一个，本例中为 HOLD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:109
#: ac6556d0db824b91aabeeb2d212018d0
msgid ""
"If :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page` is setup, RTL actions will "
"attempt to avoid any fences as it returns."
msgstr ""
"如果设置了 :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page`，RTL 动作将在返回途中尝试避开任何围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:111
#: 7257da7cdf0d4f1d93819aa3363f4e16
msgid ""
"At the moment the fence is breached a backup fence is erected 20m further "
"out (or up).  If the vehicle breaches this backup fence (for example if the "
"vehicle is not set up correctly or the operator takes control but is unable "
"to bring the copter back towards home), the vehicle will execute the "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` again (and another backup fence an "
"additional 20m further out will be created if this is breached again)."
msgstr ""
"在围栏突破的瞬间，将在距离更远（或更高）20m 处建立备用围栏。如果飞行器突破此备用围栏（例如飞行器配置不正确或操作员接管控制但无法将飞行器带回 "
"Home），飞行器将再次执行 :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` （如果再次突破，将在另外 20m "
"外创建另一个备用围栏）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:117
#: b50335c92fd64fa782b7b96bc5b2ba34
msgid ""
"If the vehicle eventually proceeds 100m outside the configured fence "
"distance, despite the backup fences, the vehicle will switch into LAND mode "
"(HOLD for Rover).  The idea being that it's clearly impossible to get the "
"vehicle home so best to just bring it down/stop it.  The pilot can still "
"retake control of course with the flight mode switches.  Like with the "
"earlier fences, another fence is erected 20m out which will again switch the"
" vehicle to LAND (HOLD for Rover), if it continues away from home."
msgstr ""
"如果飞行器最终在配置围栏距离外飞行了 100m，尽管有备用围栏，飞行器将切换到 Land 模式（Rover 为 "
"HOLD）。理由是此时显然已无法将飞行器带回 "
"Home，最好直接让其降落/停止。飞行员当然仍可通过飞行模式开关重新接管控制。与之前的围栏一样，另一个围栏将在 20m 外建立，如果飞行器继续远离 "
"Home，将再次将其切换到 Land（Rover 为 HOLD）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:126
#: 19ec5b8268954ea2be64776a16b3d159
msgid "Enabling the Fence with an RC Channel Auxiliary Switch"
msgstr "通过 RC 通道辅助开关启用围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:128
#: a14e1a8c2dd9425aae87bcf664a20312
msgid ""
"It is not necessary to set-up a switch to enable or disable the fence but if"
" you wish to control the fence with a switch follow these steps:"
msgstr "不必设置开关来启用或禁用围栏，但如果希望用开关控制围栏，请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:132
#: 8f06e7d18060401ab13e73c67f615f62
msgid ""
"An ``RCx_OPTION`` can be set via the Config/Tuning > Full Parameter List "
"screen, for example using RC channel 7:"
msgstr ""
"可通过 Config/Tuning > Full Parameter List 界面设置 ``RCx_OPTION``，例如使用 RC 通道 7："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:134
#: d3049397e26447f48982bf33bdd4cb9f
msgid "Set :ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` = 11 (Fence Enable)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` = 11（围栏启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:135
#: 030775751df14200b4a1a90fdf257c35
msgid ""
"setting the switch high (i.e. PWM > 1800) will enable all configured fences,"
" low (under 1800) will disable all fences."
msgstr "将开关拨高（即 PWM > 1800）将启用所有已配置的围栏，拨低（低于 1800）将禁用所有围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:138
#: 44a96a29c7884d97a449cfe9746c83e3
msgid ""
"if the Minimun Altitude fence is enabled by the switch while on the ground "
"and disarmed, a pre-arm failure will occur preventing arming."
msgstr "如果在地面且未解锁时通过开关启用最低高度围栏，将发生解锁前失败，阻止解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:141
#: d365242bf77d4913883b5c79c0e5ec6e
msgid "Automatic Altitude Breach Avoidance"
msgstr "自动高度突破规避"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:143
#: 4c0fdda681de4aa4a1fb65e3ab473a83
msgid ""
"For landing modes (NAV_LAND,QLAND,LAND,etc.) in Copter and Plane, the "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` limit is automatically disabled."
msgstr ""
"对于 Copter 和固定翼的降落模式（NAV_LAND、QLAND、LAND "
"等），:ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` 限制将自动禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:147
#: 8117500639504a0c957761abe5fa2e6d
msgid ""
"For Polygonal fences, Copter will stop increasing altitude at "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` in Loiter, PosHold, and AltHold modes."
msgstr ""
"对于多边形围栏，Copter 在 Loiter、PosHold 和 AltHold 模式下将在 "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MAX<FENCE_ALT_MAX>` 处停止增加高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:151
#: 4bcf1235064945878a3ff623a0795dec
msgid ""
"altitude control imperfections can still result in a breach unless the "
":ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` param is loose enough to accommodate these"
" imperfections."
msgstr "高度控制不完善仍可能导致突破，除非 :ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` 参数足够宽松以适应这些不完善之处。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:155
#: 47974dcc74224322bee8304947812578
msgid "Enabling Fences in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中启用围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:157
#: 6473842a733c4326911869aeec1728b9
msgid ""
"To enable Fences, go to the Mission Planner full parameter list "
"(CONFIG->Full Parameter Tree), search for items with ``FENCE_``:"
msgstr ""
"要启用围栏，请进入 Mission Planner 完整参数列表（CONFIG->Full Parameter Tree），搜索含 ``FENCE_``"
" 的项目："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:171
#: 826b0ccc7d3a427aae91b33b93ab1b31
msgid "Copter GeoFence Tab"
msgstr "Copter 地理围栏标签"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:173
#: 23295521c5c242d68b1d7dd81bcebbdc
msgid ""
"Copter and Traditional Heli, when connected to Mission Planner, present a "
"CONFIG tab called GeoFence which provides another way to access these "
"parameters in those vehicles."
msgstr ""
"Copter 和传统直升机连接到 Mission Planner 时，会显示名为 GeoFence 的 CONFIG "
"标签，提供访问这些飞行器参数的另一种方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:181
#: a6205dd470d54319995c84830a060a37
msgid "Use for R/C Training"
msgstr "用于 RC 训练"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:183
#: 150f97e9682644d08194d0cb4047e77f
msgid ""
"One of the main uses of geo-fencing is to teach yourself (or someone else) "
"to fly radio controlled vehicles. When you have a properly configured geo-"
"fence it is very hard to crash, and you can try manoeuvres that would "
"normally be too likely to end in a crash, trusting the autopilot to 'bounce'"
" the vehicle off the geo-fence before the flight ends in disaster."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏的主要用途之一是教自己（或他人）驾驶遥控飞行器。当您正确配置了地理围栏后，坠机变得非常困难，您可以尝试平时风险太高的动作，信任飞控会在飞行灾难发生前将飞行器「弹回」地理围栏内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:190
#: 4fff88b83e5447169880a0092a53249d
msgid ""
"Geo-fencing can be combined with any flight mode. So for a raw beginner, you"
" would combine it with one of the stabilised flight modes . Once the pilot "
"has gained some confidence you could combine it with ACRO mode in Copter or "
"MANUAL mode in Plane, which gives direct control of the vehicle and allows "
"for the most interesting aerobatic manoeuvres."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏可与任何飞行模式结合使用。对于初学者，可与某种增稳飞行模式结合使用。当飞手获得一定信心后，可与 Copter 中的 Acro 模式或固定翼中的 "
"MANUAL 模式结合使用，这可直接控制飞行器并允许最有趣的特技动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:197
#: 4539bcfe35954147a81e90614548d947
msgid "MAVLink support"
msgstr "MAVLink 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:199
#: c24d81b85ff8407e890ab4715cc0d2de
msgid ""
"ArduPilot will report the fence status via the MAVLink GCS protocol. The key"
" status packet is called FENCE_STATUS, and is defined in "
"\"ardupilotmega.xml\". A typical FENCE_STATUS packet looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 将通过 MAVLink GCS 协议报告围栏状态。关键状态数据包称为 "
"FENCE_STATUS，在「ardupilotmega.xml」中定义。典型的 FENCE_STATUS 数据包如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:207
#: fae96889457a40d598fcd6e1f0793a49
msgid ""
"The breach_status field is 0 if inside the fence, and 1 if outside. The "
"breach_count is how many fence breaches you have had on this flight. The "
"breach_type is the type of the last breach (see the FENCE_BREACH enum in "
"ardupilotmega.xml). The breach_time is the time in milliseconds of the "
"breach since APM was booted."
msgstr ""
"breach_status 字段在围栏内时为 0，在围栏外时为 1。breach_count 是本次飞行中围栏突破的次数。breach_type "
"是最近一次突破的类型（见 ardupilotmega.xml 中的 FENCE_BREACH 枚举）。breach_time 是自 APM "
"启动以来突破发生的时间（毫秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:213
#: fc222b887fea4be5a1500c5cdfbcebb0
msgid ""
"The MAV_SYS_STATUS_GEOFENCE bit of the MAV_SYS_STATUS_SENSOR portion of the "
"SYS_STATUS message indicates whether or not the geo-fence is breached.  As "
"of this writing only the MAVProxy GCS recognizes this status bit and reports"
" the status of the geo-fence.  In the future the Mission Planner, APM "
"Planner, and other GCS applications should get support for announcing geo-"
"fence status during the flight."
msgstr ""
"SYS_STATUS 消息的 MAV_SYS_STATUS_SENSOR 部分中的 MAV_SYS_STATUS_GEOFENCE "
"位指示地理围栏是否被突破。截至本文撰写时，仅 MAVProxy GCS 识别此状态位并报告地理围栏状态。未来 Mission Planner、APM "
"Planner 和其他 GCS 应用程序应获得在飞行期间宣布地理围栏状态的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:220
#: f84c297e12f44550baa4f443934de367
msgid ""
"The MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE MAVLink command message allows a GCS to enable "
"or disable a fence interactively.  As of this writing only MAVProxy supports"
" this message using the \"fence enable\" or \"fence disable\" commands.  In "
"the future Mission Planner, APM Planner, and other GCS applications may get "
"support for interactively enabling and disabling the geo-fence without "
"needing to use a manual transmitter."
msgstr ""
"MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE MAVLink 命令消息允许 GCS 以交互方式启用或禁用围栏。截至本文撰写时，仅 MAVProxy "
"支持此消息，使用「fence enable」或「fence disable」命令。未来 Mission Planner、APM Planner 和其他 "
"GCS 应用程序可能会获得无需使用手动遥控器即可交互式启用和禁用地理围栏的支持。"
